Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:39.98,SekkonSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,945)\fnFOT-TsukuBMDMin Std E-EN\fs120\fscx130\fscy120\c&HE2DFEB&}Duas Mulheres
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,SekkonSigns,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.78,0:22:21.58,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}I cannot believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.58,0:22:23.78,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}The world I used to know is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.98,0:22:28.98,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}I just woke up one day and everything changed
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:33.98,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Zetsubou risou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.78,0:22:38.78,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Yudanerare majiwaru sekai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.18,0:22:40.78,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Are you excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.78,0:22:45.78,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Netsu obiru toiki jouki suru hoho
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:50.38,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Shisen no saki de kimi ga warau
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:54.38,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Namida ukabetemo sakendemo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.38,0:22:56.68,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Tomaranai shoudou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.58,0:23:03.98,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Nigirishimeta yakusoku hanasanaide kimi wo kanjiru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.48,0:23:09.78,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Tsuranuite miseru yo kakujitsu na toko made
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:14.88,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Daremo shiranai michi no ryouiki nara oshihiraite
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.88,0:23:20.58,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&H1181F1&}Omoidasu yo tsuyoku mabushii hitomi wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.58,0:23:26.28,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Daremo yaranai nara jibun de yaru shika nai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:29.98,OP JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Just gotta do it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.78,0:22:21.58,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Eu não posso acreditar nisso!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.58,0:22:23.78,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}O mundo que eu conhecia já não existe mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.98,0:22:28.98,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Um dia acordei e tudo mudou.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:33.98,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Desespero, ideais...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.78,0:22:38.78,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}e um mundo entrelaçado que foi confiado a mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.18,0:22:40.78,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Você está animado?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.78,0:22:45.78,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Sua respiração está quente, suas bochechas estão coradas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:50.38,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Vejo você rindo em meus olhos.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:54.38,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Não importa quantas lágrimas eu chore, quantos gritos eu grite,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.38,0:22:56.68,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}não consigo parar este impulso.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.58,0:23:03.98,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}A promessa a que me agarro, não vou desistir, porque o sinto.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.48,0:23:09.78,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Vou certificar até que você esteja seguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:14.88,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&HC4E33B&}Se é um território desconhecido, eu o abrirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.88,0:23:20.58,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\1c&H1181F1&}Eu me lembrarei desses olhos fortes e deslumbrantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.58,0:23:26.28,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Se ninguém o faz, eu mesmo tenho que fazê-lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:29.98,OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Só tem que ser feito.
